@baseUrl = http://localhost:5102

### Создать категорию
# @name category
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Food","monthlyBudget":100}

### Расход в начале месяца
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId":"{{category.response.body.$.id}}","amount":60,"date":"2026-11-01","description":"Groceries"}

### Расход в конце месяца
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId":"{{category.response.body.$.id}}","amount":55,"date":"2026-11-30","description":"Dinner"}

### Соседний месяц: не попадёт в ноябрьский отчёт
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{"categoryId":"{{category.response.body.$.id}}","amount":20,"date":"2026-12-01","description":"Lunch"}

### Отчёт: Spent=115, Remaining=-15, OverBudget=true
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/monthly?year=2026&month=11

### Проверка валидации: 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/monthly?year=2026&month=13
